  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">The agamidan wield many weapons that work well with their physical form, and their combat styles feature a surprising amount of footwork to be used in fighting on uneven or sandy terrain. You gain access to all uncommon weapons with the agamidan trait. You gain familiarity with agamidan weapons and the katar, kukri, falchion, scimitar and whip. In addition, you gain access to all uncommon agamidan weapons – for the purpose of determining your proficiency, you treat any of these that are martial weapons as simple weapons and advanced weapons as martial weapons.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">At 5th level, whenever you get a critical hit with one of these weapons, you get its critical specialization effect.</span></p>"
